## Mission

Every Root Category has a unique premium visual identity for **navigation**.  
Users must recognise the category before reading its name.

## Style (mandatory)

Studio photography · White background · Soft shadow · 45° perspective · Centered · Premium lighting · Minimal distractions · Same size / margin / composition / family.

## Forbidden

Random / mixed illustration / cartoon / low-res / dark backgrounds / busy / inconsistent lighting / different perspectives / fantasy dragons on Collectables / **whole vehicles** on Vehicle Parts.

